{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmailTags:forEmail:completion:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets tags for a specific email address with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmailTags:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSDictionary","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tags","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEmail:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"email","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"kind":"text","text":")("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","